                  "body": "Owner approved the complete 23-Story set on 15 November 2026 and authorized autonomous implementation, per-Story PRs and merges through the entire Epic. Fixed scope remains the PR75 design/plan at main `65b9d8efe9ad0b729756e62c7cf0f07a0ea25c1d`. Astra authors each detailed plan; Sol implements, independently reviews and performs QA. Each Story requires meaningful verification, independent gates, current-head CI and Codex bot thumbs-up before merge. Returned findings take priority over starting/continuing new work. Out-of-scope findings become separate owner-mentioned Jira work outside this Epic. Delivery automations remain inactive; installed acceptance and activation are distinct from code merge.\n\nStarting PGB-71. Jira remains the active queue; each Story will carry exact plan, tests, review and merge evidence. Approved ordered set: PGB-71,72,73,74,99,75,76,77,78,79,80,81,82,83,84,85,86,100,101,87,88,89,90.",
