                  "body": "Parallel delivery addendum SHA256 `ffe8be4cd55ee2c65a0068d28cfa1154c4cf7dc742344b6a36bfe6048e908382` has two independent Sol CLEAN reviews: 17/17 remaining Story rows, 43/43 dependency edges, ownership/merge/4-slot capacity and all seven principles. Full reports are recorded on PGB-80. The owner authorized two concurrent streams: skills (76–79) and manager (80–86,100–101), then actual dependency joins 87–90. No new scope, removed review gate or activation; all automations remain inactive. PGB-80's distinct implementation plan is still in corrective review; approval of this delivery reorder does not approve unreviewed Story plans.",
