                  "body": "Delivery ownership update, authorized by the owner on 15 November:\n\n* Foundation manager owns PGB-80–86 in dependency order.\n* Skills/Admission manager owns PGB-77–78, then PGB-87–90 when their prerequisites are merged.\n* Health manager will start PGB-100 after PGB-84; PGB-101 also waits for PGB-86.\n* Director owns cross-stream dependencies, conflict coordination, final current-revision gates, serialized PR merges and verification of main. Managers own branch changes, feedback fixes, tests and independent reviews. No concurrent independent merges.\n\nPGB-77 has merged in [PR #90](https://github.com/danielchappell/Pigboard/pull/90), merge `4e561839f5588a97c34a960dcfb7e21964fb9d1a`. Its merged tree exactly matches the reviewed/tested tree. This brings merged implementation Stories to 9/23. Human acceptance, deployment and activation remain separate; delivery automations stay inactive.\n\nThis is contributor coordination only. The fixed product scope, dependencies and review gates are unchanged.",
